Xatu test fixture (lsne.chain, tests/test_chain_data.py)
=========================================================

Attribution and licence
-----------------------
Data: ethPandaOps Xatu (https://ethpandaops.io/posts/xatu-execution-layer/), Ethereum
mainnet canonical execution tables, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Attribution: "ethPandaOps Xatu".
Changes: the files below are row subsets of the original chunks (pyarrow Table.filter,
original Arrow schemas kept, re-written with zstd compression); no values were modified.

