https://data.ethpandaops.io/xatu/mainnet/databases/default/canonical_execution_block/1000/1920000.parquet

File layout is the lsne.chain.xatu cache layout
(canonical_execution_<table>_<start>.parquet), so
lsne.chain.xatu.load_chunk_rows(<start>, "tests/fixtures/xatu") reads it directly.
Chunk 1718000 has no transaction / erc20_transfers / storage_reads / block files on
purpose: it exercises the "no transaction row" path of build_records
(gas_source = "trace_estimate").

